            <note corresp="#d267-f1" n="1" xml:id="d267-f1-content">
                <p>See article 15, Treaty of Peace signed at Lausanne, July 24, 1923, League of
                    Nations Treaty Series, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">xxviii</hi>, pp. 13, 23.
                    For documentation regarding the Lausanne Conference, see <ref
                        target="frus1923v02#pg_879">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1923, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, pp. 879</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
